    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>Establishing a factory for the production of marble and granite located in Riyadh, spanning 49,666 square meters. The facility includes a production line with an annual total production capacity of 780,000 square meters of diversified marble and granite products, catering to various color and size preferences.</p>\r\n",
